{"id":"veces","lemma":"veces","pos":"prep","rank":174,"glosses":["by, times (multiplication)"],"ipa":"/ˈbeθes/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-veces.wav","examples":[{"text":"A veces me siento triste.","en":"I feel sad sometimes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551835","words":[{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"As a temporary state."}]},{"text":"A veces nos encontramos con ellos.","en":"We sometimes meet them.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458648","words":[{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"us"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"they","l":"él"}]},{"text":"A veces odio mi trabajo.","en":"I hate my job sometimes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/171775","words":[{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"hate"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"work, job"}]},{"text":"A veces me odio a mí mismo.","en":"I hate myself sometimes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/825980","words":[{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"hate"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"same"}]},{"text":"Te lo he dicho muchas veces.","en":"I've told you many times.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639266","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"saying, expression"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]}]}